Shipment:

```json
{"eventId":"evt-01JNX2T4A8FQ","orderId":"ORD-2025-1042","occurredAt":"2025-03-08T10:15:30Z","customerId":"CUS-8821","fulfillmentType":"shipment","totalAmount":129.90,"currency":"USD","destination":{"country":"US","postalCode":"98101"},"items":[{"sku":"SHOE-RUN-BLK-42","quantity":1}]}
```

Store pickup:

```json
{"eventId":"evt-01JNX2V7M21R","orderId":"ORD-2025-1043","occurredAt":"2025-03-08T10:17:05Z","customerId":"CUS-1940","fulfillmentType":"store_pickup","totalAmount":48.50,"currency":"GBP","storeId":"LON-017","pickupWindow":"2025-03-08T16:00:00Z","items":[{"sku":"HEADPHONES-WL-02","quantity":1}]}
