Digital:

```json
{"eventId":"evt-01JNX2XK9C5P","orderId":"ORD-2025-1044","occurredAt":"2025-03-08T10:20:11Z","customerId":"CUS-7342","fulfillmentType":"digital","totalAmount":19.99,"currency":"EUR","deliveryEmail":"buyer@example.test","items":[{"sku":"EBOOK-DISTRIBUTED-SYSTEMS","quantity":1}]}
